  {
   "id": "duck-detective-the-secret-salami-279374@major-2024-09-22",
   "gameId": "duck-detective-the-secret-salami-279374",
   "displayName": "German Language & Workshop Support Update!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-09-22T17:01:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello detectives,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have two wonderful pieces of news!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have added German language support to Duck Detective, and we have also added Steam Workshop support so new unofficial translations can be added!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Localising the game ended up being a lot more work than we initially thought - it's very tricky translating deducktions to new languages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "HOWEVER",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We want to give you all the opportunity to enjoy Duck Detective in more languages so we have an extra surprise!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have added Steam Workshop support to the game so anyone in the community can create translations!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Korean has already been included as a language in the workshop! A big thank you to Ashtokki for providing their fan translation and helping iron out bugs with the workshop tools:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To anyone interested, here you can find a guide on how to get started with localizing the game:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also check out this amazing fan-art of Eugene's office by Redux3d :",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also we are going to have a limited run physical edition on Switch starting 26th September! It comes with some exclusive Duck Detective content including never before seen early concepts of the game. Can find more info here: https://superraregames.com/",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks to all of you for your amazing support, and stay tuned for more cool updates that are in the works",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "~Happy Broccoli Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
